      "writtenOn": "2017-01-20T20:20:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1: This class is an abstraction for carrier filtering. Adding a controller does not provide lot of value. For instance call filtering is handled by IncomingCallFilter.java which in turn initiates other filters.\n2: I will be adding the IMS filter here so the has semantics doesn\u0027t make sense: This class will abstract the filtering.\n3. See 2, and I would like to avoid stateful caching wherever possible.",
